{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなこだよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ空いちゃってごめんなさい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業試験やイベントやリハで\nいっぱいいっぱいで、なかなか\nブログ書けませんでした( ºΔº )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月後半から2月中、人生で1番勉強したおかげで卒業できるよ～٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいわーい٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなことがたまってしまったので、何回かにまとめて書きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはじめに、アルバム握手会のこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京会場では、\n1部 春のメロディー\n2部 何度目の青空か？\n3部 走れ！Bicycle\nを、着ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディーは、\n1部でみんな眠たいと思ったから\n目が覚める色は？！！と、思い\n青色を選んだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がぶっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あげないよーっー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部の何度目の青空か？は、衣装さんにあんまりぽくないから着てみたら？と、言われ着てみた♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部は着たかった衣装の1つ！ステージデビューの時は緑色だったけど、今回はピンクにした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪を巻く前！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都会場は、\n1部 あの日 僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた\n2部 ぐるぐるカーテン\n3部 制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの日 僕は咄嗟に嘘をついたは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方で着たことがないと思って着ました！だから、初めて見る方も多かったみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテンは、ライブ以外で着たことがなかったからきたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真顔でほっぺにつきさす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真顔でほっぺを押しすぎる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンは、好きな衣装の1つで皆んなに見て欲しかったから着ちゃった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は個別握手会のこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.2部がこれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんが1人で写真とってたから\n入り込んだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/02/28/3293348/0013.